#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Ketahui tentang peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service {#activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service, generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr "Perkhidmatan IBM Cloud&reg;, seperti IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service, menjana peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit requirements.\n"
msgstr "Peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti melaporkan aktiviti yang mengubah keadaan perkhidmatan dalam IBM Cloud. Anda boleh menggunakan peristiwa ini untuk menyiasat aktiviti luar biasa dan tindakan kritikal serta untuk mematuhi keperluan audit kawal selia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan Penghalaan Peristiwa Penjejak Aktiviti IBM Cloud, perkhidmatan platform, untuk menghalakan peristiwa audit dalam akaun anda ke destinasi pilihan anda dengan mengkonfigurasi sasaran dan laluan yang menentukan ke mana peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti dihantar. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [Tentang Penghalaan Peristiwa Penjejak Aktiviti IBM Cloud.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan IBM Cloud Logs untuk menggambarkan dan memberi amaran tentang peristiwa yang dijana dalam akaun anda dan dihalakan oleh Penghalaan Peristiwa Penjejak Aktiviti IBM Cloud ke instance IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where activity tracking events are generated {#locations-where-activity-tracking-events-are-generated}"
msgstr "Lokasi di mana peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti dijana {#locations-where-activity-tracking-events-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service sends activity tracking events in the following regions:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service menghantar peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti di rantau berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Washington (\"us-east\")\n"
msgstr "Washington (\"us-east\")\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Frankfurt (\"eu-de\")\n"
msgstr "Frankfurt (\"eu-de\")\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing activity tracking events for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Melihat peristiwa penjejakan aktiviti untuk IBM Quantum Compute Service {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Melancarkan IBM Cloud Logs dari halaman Kebolehperhatian {#launching-ibm-cloud-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat tentang melancarkan UI IBM Cloud Logs, lihat [Melancarkan UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) dalam dokumentasi IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

